// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P306676907" "Whoah, {Hero.gender=male guy|girl}...  What am I doing here? Wait... Don't tell me. I'm Null the Gull (tm), a seagull with reality-altering powers, I should be able to figure this one out.<br><br><i>(Null the Gull pauses for a moment.)</i><br><br>I've got it! This must be <color orange>exactly where I'm supposed to be.</color> Am I right, or am I right?"
// Answer Text :
"P2618730796" "Uh..."
// Answer Text :
"P2517887750" "I guess."
// Answer Text :
"P405491381" "Who are you?"
// Answer Text :
"P164734052" "What can you do?"
// Page AboutMe Text :
"P3147607893" "<i>(Null the Gull takes a deep breath.)</i><br><br>...<br><br>Well, I'm a talking seagull, for starters. I also have fantastic reality-altering powers! Powers I will gladly employ to making your life that much more quality. Or qualifying your living. Or... well it will come to me some day, I'm sure."
// Answer Text :
"P1219206878" "Tell me more about these powers."
// Page EnoughAboutMe Text :
"P1512118385" "I suppose you don't really care who I am. I seem to know an awful lot about you though. For starters, you're quite obviously insane, talking to a seagull and all, but I'll overlook all that and gladly share with you my fantastic reality-altering powers! At least until the System discovers I've Gone Rogue (tm) and tracks me down, that is."
// Answer Text :
"P1593282434" "The System?"
// Page SystemIsDown Text :
"P719397128" "You don't think I got this name because I come from a land of magical talking gulls, do you? You know... <i>the System</i>? Wink wink nudge wink and all that."
// Answer Text :
"P2943973651" "So tell me about those powers."
// Page RealityPowers Text :
"P3718422930" "I'm still getting used to this multiverse, you'll have to be a little patient. Ok... Summoning up my fantastic reality-altering powers (tm) now.<br><br>It appears that as of now, I can:<br><br><color deepskyblue>Alter how speed buffs/debuffs from other friendly players affect you.<br>Alter how group travel powers affect you.<br>Change whether or not you are asked to confirm Mystic Fortune.<br>Show your progress towards the Dimensional Warder badge.</color><br><br>... And that's all for now. Not that I supposed you're interested in that in the slightest, I'm sure."
// Answer Text :
"P605888820" "Could you alter how speed buffs/debuffs affect me?"
// Answer Text :
"P2865920182" "Could you alter how group travel powers affect me?"
// Answer Text :
"P861544775" "Could you change my Mystic Fortune preference?"
// Answer Text :
"P3063595375" "Could you show my Dimensional Warder progress?"
// Page SpeedBuffsTurnedOff Text :
"P2472833841" "Seems you've already asked me to cause you to be unaffected by buffs and debuffs to your movement speed from some powers which can be used on you by others. I can reverse this for you, no charge. Just say the word.<br><br><color orange>If you select this option, you will again have your run, jump, and flight speed affected by the powers Speed Boost, Increase Density, Inertial Reduction, Enforced Morale, and Accelerate Metabolism. The other components of those powers will still affect you. Other powers such as Sprint and Super Speed will be unaffected by this setting. You can reverse this setting at any time by returning to Null the Gull.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P36860286" "Make other players speed buffs affect me."
// Page SpeedBuffsOn Text :
"P2801865315" "And... Done! You are now affected by speed buffing powers once again... Whatever that means."
// Page SpeedBuffsTurnedOn Text :
"P1046686060" "Ok, here's the deal. Don't spread this around, but via my fantastic reality-altering powers, I can cause you to be unaffected by buffs and debuffs to your movement speed from some powers which can be used on you by other players. This means you'll get the other benefits of those powers, but that your running, jumping, flying speed and such will be unaffected. Course, I can't really tell if you're the one using the power or someone else is, so you'll just have to go with the flow. And I won't touch things like Sprint or Super Speed or Flight or Reverse Radial Umbral Rotation or what have you, just what I mention below. So if this appeals to you, just say the word.<br><br><color orange>If you select this option, your run, jump, and flight speed will be unaffected by the powers Speed Boost, Increase Density, Inertial Reduction, Enforced Morale, and Accelerate Metabolism. The other components of those powers will still affect you. Other powers such as Sprint and Super Speed will be unaffected by this setting. You can reverse this setting at any time by returning to Null the Gull.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2462349855" "Make other players speed buffs not affect me."
// Page SpeedBuffsOff Text :
"P3384488040" "And... Done! You are now immune to the speed buffing components of those powers I mentioned... Whatever that means."
// Page MysticFortuneAlwaysDenied Text :
"P2768685264" "Seems you've already asked me to mark you as someone who always wants to deny the Mystic Fortune power. I can change this so that you will always be asked to confirm the power, or change it so that you will always be assumed that you want the power cast on you, no charge. Just say the word.<br><br><color orange> Choosing to always be asked to confirm Mystic Fortune means that if another player uses the power on you, you will see the confirmation dialog every time. Choosing to always accept means that if another player uses the power on you, it will automatically be applied as if you chose to accept the power. You can change this setting at any time by returning to Null the Gull.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3837742487" "Make me always accept Mystic Fortune on myself."
// Answer Text :
"P866066475" "Make me always be asked whether to accept or deny Mystic Fortune on myself."
// Page MysticFortuneAlwaysAccepted Text :
"P3709983082" "Seems you've already asked me to mark you as someone who always wants to accept Mystic Fortune. I can change this so that you will always be asked to confirm the power, or change it so that you will always be assumed that you want to deny the power cast on you, no charge. Just say the word.<br><br><color orange> Choosing to always be asked to confirm Mystic Fortune means that if another player uses the power on you, you will see the confirmation dialog every time. Choosing to always deny means that another player cannot use the power on you. You can change this setting at any time by returning to Null the Gull.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3964191539" "Make me always deny Mystic Fortune on myself."
// Page MysticFortuneAlwaysAsked Text :
"P125191110" "So right now, everytime someone uses the power Mystic Fortune on you, you're asked whether or not you want your fortune read. If you have a consistent preference, I can spread the word: you can choose to always accept Mystic Fortune or always deny Mystic Fortune (meaning no one can use it on you). Should you change your mind, I can change your preference later.<br><br><color orange> Choosing to always accept Mystic Fortune means that if another player uses the power on you, it will automatically be applied without displaying the confirmation dialog. Choosing to always deny means that another player cannot use the power on you at all. You can change this setting at any time by returning to Null the Gull.</color>"
// Page MysticFortuneAlwaysAccept Text :
"P1705607612" "And... Done! You will now always accept anyone using Mystic Fortune on yourself... Whatever that means."
// Page MysticFortuneAlwaysDeny Text :
"P3573398569" "And... Done! You will now always deny anyone using Mystic Fortune on yourself... Whatever that means."
// Page MysticFortuneAlwaysAsk Text :
"P3998920853" "And... Done! You will now always be asked to confirm or deny every time someone uses Mystic Fortune on yourself... Whatever that means."
// Page DimensionalWarderOwned Text :
"P3501220487" "Hey, don't try to pull a fast one on ol' Nully here. You already are known as a Dimensional Warder - I don't need to help you figure that one out."
// Page DimensionalWarderInProgress Text :
"P2519930618" "Whew, there are an awful lot of Praetorians swimming about. Let's try to break this down for poor Null here. What section do you want to check?"
// Answer Text :
"P777170647" "Anti-Matter through Infernal."
// Answer Text :
"P474641219" "Malaise through Siege."
// Page DimensionalWarderPart1 Text :
"P2252615798" "I know when you're trashing Praetorians it can get a little confusing who you've taken down and who you haven't. Null the Gull knows the score... Let me remind you.<br><br><i>(Null the Gull stares at you.)</i><br><br>Now... Concentrate!"
// Answer Text :
"P1408652471" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Anti-Matter."
// Answer Text :
"P223671935" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Battle Maiden."
// Answer Text :
"P1314746611" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Black Swan."
// Answer Text :
"P1549096746" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Bobcat."
// Answer Text :
"P4272842453" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Chimera."
// Answer Text :
"P958562983" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Diabolique."
// Answer Text :
"P307946616" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Dominatrix."
// Answer Text :
"P465227230" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Infernal."
// Answer Text :
"P1674453052" "Let me check the others."
// Answer Text :
"P1989962504" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Malaise."
// Answer Text :
"P255428739" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Marauder."
// Answer Text :
"P3775542728" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Mother Mayhem."
// Answer Text :
"P498581679" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Neuron."
// Answer Text :
"P1852479639" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Nightstar."
// Answer Text :
"P2366517430" "I suddenly recall I have yet to defeat Siege."
// Page DimensionalWarderEnd Text :
"P2708441997" "Don't worry, I'm sure you'll get them soon enough."
// Page GroupTravel Text :
"P324616557" "Sure, I understand that sometimes you don't want to move with the flock. Be a rebel, and all that. Are we talking about Group Fly or Team Teleport here?"
// Answer Text :
"P3188959696" "Group Fly"
// Answer Text :
"P1296701892" "Team Teleport"
// Page GroupFlyTurnedOff Text :
"P3338836793" "Seems you've already asked me to make you immune to Group Fly. I can reverse this for you, no charge. Just say the word.<br><br><color orange>If you select this option, you will again be affected by the powers Group Fly and Group Energy Flight. Other flight powers such as Fly and Bright Nova will be unaffected by this setting. You can reverse this setting at any time by returning to Null the Gull.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2673727134" "Make me affected by Group Fly."
// Page GroupFlyOn Text :
"P328466731" "And... Done! You are now affected by Group Fly once again... Whatever that means."
// Page GroupFlyTurnedOn Text :
"P1964608082" "If you like, I can make you immune to Group Fly. You'll be able to keep your feet on the ground no matter what. If you change your mind later, come back and I can reverse it as well.<br><br><color orange>If you select this option, you will be unaffected by the powers Group Fly and Group Energy Flight, even if you use those powers yourself. Your pets and minions will still be affected by those powers. Other flight powers such as Fly and Bright Nova will be unaffected by this setting. You can reverse this setting at any time by returning to Null the Gull.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P675944607" "Make me immune to Group Fly."
// Page GroupFlyOff Text :
"P3838057491" "And... Done! You are now immune to Group Fly... Whatever that means."
// Page TeamTeleportTurnedOff Text :
"P1180799666" "Seems you've already asked me to make you immune to Team Teleport. I can reverse this for you, no charge. Just say the word.<br><br><color orange>If you select this option, you will again be affected by the power Team Teleport. Other teleportation powers such as Teleport and Shadow Step will be unaffected by this setting. You can reverse this setting at any time by returning to Null the Gull.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2058943707" "Make me affected by Team Teleport."
// Page TeamTeleportOn Text :
"P3382334751" "And... Done! You are now affected by Team Teleport once again... Whatever that means."
// Page TeamTeleportTurnedOn Text :
"P2043374283" "If you like, I can make you immune to Team Teleport. You'll be able to remain anchored in space. If you change your mind later, come back and I can reverse it as well.<br><br><color orange>If you select this option, you will be unaffected by the power Team Teleport, even if you use those powers yourself. Your pets and minions will still be affected by those powers. Other teleportation powers such as Teleport and Shadow Step will be unaffected by this setting. You can reverse this setting at any time by returning to Null the Gull.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P162759245" "Make me immune to Team Teleport."
// Page TeamTeleportOff Text :
"P2988205972" "And... Done! You are now immune to Team Teleport... Whatever that means."
